'''Pokémon Adventures: The S.S. Ann Adventure''' is the twenty-fourth monthly issue released by [[VIZ Media]] of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga created by [[Hidenori Kusaka]] and [[Mato]]. It contains chapters fourteen, fifteen, and sixteen of the {{MangaArc|Yellow}}. The chapters originally released in this book were later rereleased as part of {{PAV|5}}. As a bonus, it contained a sheet of Pokémon stickers which were not included with the collected volume release.

